{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 40","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_40\">Problem 40</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 40\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/9/af930ca5e397e86ddc299177b4af78f0b5f442ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$V = gt + V_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/4/2f43d3182934e596554bf23f675aa5645ebda895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\frac {1}{2}gt^2 + V_0t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"119\" height=\"37\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> equals: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/a/eba74d232a02e44eadabb19af5899f3a20dd284b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{2S}{V+V_0}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{2S}{V-V_0}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{2S}{V_0-V}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{2S}{V}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 2S-V$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"563\" height=\"40\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> in the first equation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/e/39e7bd96ea60e7bb4e475ee27b7a4e4039e2c528.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[V - V_0 = gt\\]\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/6/a96e43f77a61009a3573b3f0c5a4f7f83b3546bb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t = \\frac{V - V_0}{g}\\]\" width=\"88\" height=\"40\" />\nThen use the second equation to solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/6/ad6b2df4617e3583ab1d34583bdeb7efa4eab6f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g:$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/f/5cfe0d6c0d11b99def5a3b4dfdb7a9ada7fac716.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2(S - V_0 t) = gt^2\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/a/41a8602ac8434f50a2ac74a87890c078656173e0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[g = \\frac{2(S - V_0 t)}{t^2}\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/b/9cbe2c62d05dc7dcd0fb02af8528cb43452620b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"44\" height=\"28\" />\n-coolmath34\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em